#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:210
msgid ""
"The Anthropic surface stores the full provenance, not just the verdict — "
"so a disputed address can be re-derived from the row. The two `CF-"
"Connecting-*` headers are logged but not persisted on any surface."
msgstr ""
"Anthropic 这个接口面存下的是完整来历，而不只是判定结果——因此有争议的地址可以从这一行里重新推导出来。两个 `CF-Connecting-*` 头会写日志，但在任何接口面上都不会持久化。"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:214
msgid ""
"**`login_events`** "
"(`apps/backend/serving/storage/postgres_operational.py`) stores `ip` and "
"`user_agent` per login attempt alongside the outcome."
msgstr ""
"**`login_events`**（`apps/backend/serving/storage/postgres_operational.py`）为每次登录尝试存下"
" `ip` 和 `user_agent`，以及这次尝试的结果。"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:217
msgid "Retention is yours to set"
msgstr "保留期由你自己定"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:219
msgid ""
"Nothing in this repository expires either table on a timer. The only "
"deletions that exist are operator-initiated:"
msgstr "本仓库里没有任何东西会按定时器让这两张表过期。现有的删除操作全部由运维方主动发起："

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:222
msgid ""
"`DELETE /admin/login-events?older_than_days=N` — purge `login_events` by "
"age."
msgstr "`DELETE /admin/login-events?older_than_days=N`——按时间清理 `login_events`。"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:223
msgid "`DELETE /admin/login-events?user_id=...` — purge one user's login events."
msgstr "`DELETE /admin/login-events?user_id=...`——清理某一个用户的登录事件。"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:224
msgid "`hard_delete_user_data(user_id)` — wipes that user's `api_logs` rows."
msgstr "`hard_delete_user_data(user_id)`——抹掉该用户的 `api_logs` 行。"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:225
msgid "`delete_recent_error_requests(hours=N)` — drops recent error rows."
msgstr "`delete_recent_error_requests(hours=N)`——删掉近期的错误行。"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:227
msgid ""
"If your deployment is subject to a data-protection regime, or you simply "
"do not want to hold client addresses indefinitely, you must decide on and"
" implement a retention policy yourself. This project does not ship one "
"and does not pick a default on your behalf."
msgstr "如果你的部署要受某种数据保护法规约束，或者你只是不想无限期地保存客户端地址，那就必须自己决定并实现一套保留策略。本项目不附带这样的策略，也不替你选一个默认值。"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:232
msgid "Two knobs that reduce what there is to retain in the first place:"
msgstr "有两个开关能从源头上减少需要保留的数据："

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:234
msgid ""
"Leaving both trust flags at `0` where no proxy is in front means only the"
" socket peer is ever recorded."
msgstr "在前面没有代理的情况下把两个信任开关都留在 `0`，那么被记录下来的就只有 socket 对端。"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:236
msgid ""
"Prompt and response content is governed separately by "
"`DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` (default `false`, which hashes content rather "
"than storing it verbatim; see `apps/backend/serving/config/settings.py`)."
msgstr ""
"prompt 和响应的内容由 `DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` 单独控制（默认 `false`，即对内容做哈希而不是原样存下；见 "
"`apps/backend/serving/config/settings.py`）。"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:240
msgid "Testing your setup"
msgstr "验证你的配置"

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:242
msgid ""
"`tests/unit/utils/test_request_ip.py` covers the resolution table, the "
"Pseudo IPv4 corroboration and the bucketing rules; "
"`tests/unit/middleware/test_request_log.py` covers the log fields. Run "
"them with:"
msgstr ""
"`tests/unit/utils/test_request_ip.py` 覆盖解析顺序表、Pseudo IPv4 "
"的互相印证以及分桶规则；`tests/unit/middleware/test_request_log.py` 覆盖日志字段。运行方式："

#: ../developer/trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md:251
msgid ""
"To check a live gateway, send a request with a deliberately absurd "
"forwarded header and look at the `ip_source` in the resulting log line — "
"it tells you which rung the gateway actually believed."
msgstr "要检查一个正在运行的网关，就发一个带着刻意离谱的转发头的请求，然后看产生的那行日志里的 `ip_source`——它会告诉你网关实际相信的是哪一级。"

